description	"HK-47 - The Assassin Droid

^2Weaponry:
- Repeating Blaster Rifle (T-21 3)
- Disruptor Rifle (Amban Blaster 1)
- Droid Flamethrower Attachment ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- No Locational Damage
- Melee Resistance
- Magnetic Plating
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Close Combat Training (1)

HK-47 was a Hunter-Killer series assassin droid and Jedi hunter constructed by the Dark Lord of the Sith, Darth Revan, shortly after the end of the Mandalorian Wars in 3960 BBY."